                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.00/2618: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the High Commissioner in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-12-06T12:00:00-05:00">December 6,
                        1929—noon</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>64. Your 92, December 5, noon. Orders have been given for immediate despatch of
                    five hundred Marines to Haiti.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
